      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a draft for your error message: \"Your transfer couldn't complete due to insufficient funds, but please don't worry—we can help you sort this out easily. You can check your available balance in the app or contact support if you'd like guidance moving forward.\" \n\nThis draft balances clarity with empathy to ensure the user feels supported rather than scolded, while maintaining a professional tone appropriate for financial transactions. It directly addresses the problem and offers clear next steps without relying on forced positivity.",
