    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, it definitely feels professional. \n\nthough, i just ran it through our sentiment parser and the score came back a bit lower than i was hoping for. it's a little \"dry.\" could you try a few more variations? \n\ntry to see if you can bump that positivity score up a notch without being weird about it. just make it feel a bit more upbeat and reassuring for the customer. remember, still keep it professional though—i really don't want it to look like we're making light of their money issues.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
