      "content": "Here are a few variations that aim for a warmer, more reassuring tone while maintaining professionalism and financial gravity:\n\n\"Your transfer didn't go through because of insufficient funds, but rest assured we are here to help you get straight back on track. We encourage you to review your current balance in the app or reach out to our friendly support team for personalized next steps today.\"\n\nThis draft uses direct comforts like \"rest assured\" and \"get straight back on track\" to lift the sentiment without softening the core message. It emphasizes our readiness to assist immediately, which can improve the perceived helpfulness and positivity of the feedback.",
